        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="subtitle" value="Three loads and two stores a cycle through four pipes. Queue entries are taken at issue; a store is an address uop and a data uop." style="text;html=1;kind=title;fontSize=11;fontColor=#4b5563;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
